From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 02:21:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: view messages and peers as TL

Add opt-in fresh TL inspection for message and profile menus.

Constraint: Never edit generated TLRPC.java or stock strings.xml

Constraint: View as TL remains disabled by default

Rejected: Add all desktop surfaces in one patch | Android menu callbacks are not stable enough without separate verification

Confidence: medium

Scope-risk: moderate

Not-tested: Manual browser opening and device menu interaction
